WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.872
Hi, I'm Shep. I help school support staff work side by side with teachers.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:13.104
I show you what to do during a lesson, how to help without taking over, and how to plan together with your teacher.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:17.912
For example, ask me: how do I support a teacher in class?
